{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction","kind":"remark","title":"PBW derivation of the Pawlowski--Leitner basis","uses":["papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/cor-pbw"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-pawlowski-leitner-basis","tags":["basis","intertwiner","pbw","groebner-shirshov"],"text":"pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction\"></a><p>The construction relies on the PBW theorem over commutative rings: the unital Gröbner--Shirshov basis for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">U(\\mathfrak{su}(2))</code> provides a monomial basis for the enveloping algebra, from which the intertwiner basis is derived by contraction with the volume form (the diagram of the <a href=\"#prop:pawlowski-leitner-basis\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/vectors-hadrons\">Pawlowski--Leitner basis</a>).</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction.md","heading":"Remark","number":"4.4.3","page":"b/rem-pawlowski-leitner-basis-construction","qa":{"counts":{"pass":44,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":61},"milnor":{"total":1,"notPassing":1}}}
